  "mn43:22.17": "",
  "mn43:22.18": "",
  "mn43:22.19": "Vitality-fabrications are the intentions to continue living. The Buddha entered total nibbāna three months after abandoning his vitality-fabrications. See <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn16'>DN 16</a>.",
